        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "As dynamic control mode delegate the energy transfer control to an off-board system, one could argue that this control mode is not necessary in DC. However, it is required to keep both control modes because the processes and information exchanges differ.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
